# 🙋 of 🐟: both the receiver of 🎁 and the dynamically allocated generic argument descriptions it is passed, which
# neither ejcRelease nor a global constant would clean up, are released if evaluating an argument reraises.
@ ^_\.class_1f41f\.type\.1f64b-
+ call void @ejcReleaseWithoutDeinit\(ptr %alloc\)
+ call void @free\(
